{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Cucumber Champion&quot; embark on a whimsical journey into the fantastical world of cats where you, as the valiant Cucumber Warrior, wield a cucumber as your mighty weapon. The adventure begins with a curious cat animation pondering its purpose with the text &quot;What am I doing?&quot; before being whisked away into the depths of its own imagination, revealing a realm teeming with feline wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cucumber Champion is a 5-10 minute game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with: Unity 2021.3.1f1</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2823470?t=1772129194","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2823470?t=1772129194","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823470/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772129194","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2823470/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772129194","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Cucumber Champion&quot; embark on a whimsical journey into the fantastical world of cats where you, as the valiant Cucumber Warrior, wield a cucumber as your mighty weapon. The adventure begins with a curious cat animation pondering its purpose with the text &quot;What am I doing?&quot; before being whisked away into the depths of its own imagination, revealing a realm teeming with feline wonders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cucumber Champion is a 5-10 minute game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made with: Unity 2021.3.1f1</p>","developers":["Relevation Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"2